                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>pero a:mo... no: timopale:wihkeh tehwa:n, t'ta:lihkeh *faenas**, eh, tehwa:n t'ta:lihkeh *faenas**.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a308" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts606" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts607">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Ihkó:n ke:meh *cooperativa** tosepan kichi:w n' *ibodegas, primeras bodegas** tein de kwesala:n, ne: Nahuiogpan ne:n *bodega** ika *faenas**.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
